  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 33322045440
    m_Localized: Teluric Strike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1375277027328
    m_Localized: Attacks with an elemental strike capable of shattering rock and
      increases physical attack damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36253863936
    m_Localized: Earthen Shield
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1375277027330
    m_Localized: Creates a barrier of earth that halves all damage received by the
      party for that turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1375277027332
    m_Localized: Scorching Breath
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1375277027333
    m_Localized: Boosts the Attack of the entire party using the fury of flames.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1375277027335
    m_Localized: Delirious Flame
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1375277027336
    m_Localized: Deals fire damage to the enemy with a chance to inflict Delusion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1375277027338
    m_Localized: Gale Slash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1375277027339
    m_Localized: Strikes the enemy with a gale, adding wind damage and a chance to
      perform a second hit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1375277027341
    m_Localized: Ethereal Shroud
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1375277027342
    m_Localized: Channels a gentle air current to raise the Elemental Resistance
      of the entire party.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1375277027344
    m_Localized: Vital Spring
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1375277027345
    m_Localized: Uses the power of water to restore a moderate amount of HP to an
      ally.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1375277027347
    m_Localized: Numbing Blizzard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1375277027348
    m_Localized: Unleashes a blast of ice that damages the enemy and lowers their
      Attack power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
